## Approach
2 nested loops are used and then the start variable which sets the initial value for every row with the formula (i^2-i+2)/2 and then in the inner loop we derived the formula start-j+1 for the sequence .

## Solution
```java[]
class Solution {
    public void pattern13(int n) {
        for (int i =1; i<=n;i++){
            int start = (i*i-i+2)/2;

            for (int j = 1; j<=i;j++){
                System.out.print(start+j-1 + " ");
            }
            start= start+1;
            System.out.println();
        }

    }
}
```

